  "name": "simplebuilder",
  "description": "A minimalist shell utility designed to automate the batch compilation of Arch Linux packages directly from the Arch Build System (ABS) tree. It processes package identifiers via standard input, leveraging makepkg for dependency resolution and unattended installation while maintaining persistent logs of build results. The script implements robust signal handling to ensure clean state reporting during interrupted execution cycles.",
